    "a": "H–C(=O)–O–CH2CH3 (formiato de etila).",
    "b": "CH3–CH2–OH (etanol).",
    "c": "CH3–CH(OH)–CH2–CH3 (butan-2-ol).",
    "d": "CH3–C(=O)–CH3 (propanona/acetona).",
    "e": "(CH3)2CH–CH2–OH (2-metilpropan-1-ol / álcool isobutílico)."
